funky-mage-school-elementalism-name = Elementalism
funky-mage-school-honkamancy-name = Honkamancy
funky-mage-package-honkamancy-l1-desc = The sacred prankster's path—rubber chickens, razor grins, and vows whispered through horn squeaks.
funky-mage-spell-evil-pie-name = Evil Pie
funky-mage-spell-evil-pie-desc = Conjure a pie that splats and leaves a toxic punchline in the bloodstream.
funky-mage-spell-clown-transform-name = Clown Transformation
funky-mage-spell-clown-transform-desc = After naming yourself with intent, endure a lengthy ritual to don blessed clown regalia, paperwork, and a sturdier punchline for your biology.
funky-mage-spell-honk-banana-snack-name = Banana Snack
funky-mage-spell-honk-banana-snack-desc = Conjures a blessed banana laden with sustenance and medicine. It crumbles into nothing after a short while.
funky-mage-honk-blessed-banana-name = blessed banana
funky-mage-honk-blessed-banana-desc = A potassium-rich gift from the Honkmother. Eat it quickly — this bit does not last.
funky-mage-spellpick-bee-honker = Bee Honker
funky-mage-spellpick-bee-swarm = Bee Honker Swarm
funky-mage-spellpick-mark-of-cluwne = Mark of the Cluwne
funky-mage-spell-honk-bee-honker-name = Bee Honker
funky-mage-spell-honk-bee-honker-desc = Summon a loyal bee that stings foes and injects Honk into their veins. It will not harm you.
funky-mage-spell-honk-bee-swarm-name = Bee Honker Swarm
funky-mage-spell-honk-bee-swarm-desc = Summon three Bee Honkers at once—a buzzing punchline with wings.
funky-mage-spell-mark-of-cluwne-name = Mark of the Cluwne
funky-mage-spell-mark-of-cluwne-desc = Brand a living victim with the Honkmother's curse, twisting their body into a hateful cluwne until death frees them. Wounds carry between the two forms.
funky-mage-behonker-ray-fire-name = Flame Gaze
funky-mage-behonker-ray-fire-desc = Sweep a line of searing heat toward the clicked tile.
funky-mage-behonker-ray-ice-name = Frost Gaze
funky-mage-behonker-ray-ice-desc = Sweep a line of biting cold toward the clicked tile.
funky-mage-behonker-ray-earth-name = Stone Gaze
funky-mage-behonker-ray-earth-desc = Sweep a concussive line toward the clicked tile.
funky-mage-behonker-ray-electric-name = Storm Gaze
funky-mage-behonker-ray-electric-desc = Sweep a shocking line toward the clicked tile.
funky-mage-spellpick-honk-stub-t2b = Slipstream (stub)
funky-mage-spellpick-bouncing-banana = Bouncing Banana Bullet
funky-mage-spell-bouncing-banana-name = Bouncing Banana Bullet
funky-mage-spell-bouncing-banana-desc = Hurl an enchanted banana that ricochets off foes and scenery—up to ten hops or three seconds of chaos, seeking living targets when it can.
funky-mage-bouncing-banana-projectile-name = honk banana
funky-mage-bouncing-banana-projectile-desc = Peel your eyes. It does not peel itself.
funky-mage-spellpick-slip-bomb = Slip Bomb
funky-mage-spell-honk-slip-bomb-name = Slip Bomb
funky-mage-spell-honk-slip-bomb-desc = Launch a volatile water drop that bursts into Space Lube on impact.
funky-mage-spellpick-comical-barrier = Comical Barrier
funky-mage-spell-honk-comical-barrier-name = Comical Barrier
funky-mage-spell-honk-comical-barrier-desc = Erect an immobile clown dummy barricade. It lasts three minutes unless destroyed first.
funky-mage-spellpick-clownsurrection = Clownsurrection
funky-mage-spell-honk-clownsurrection-name = Clownsurrection
funky-mage-spell-honk-clownsurrection-desc = Raise a dead body as a loyal cluwne servant devoted to your punchline.

funky-mage-evil-pie-entity-name = evil pie
funky-mage-evil-pie-entity-desc = It smells like punchlines and minor lacerations.
funky-mage-honk-transform-dialog-title = Clown transformation
funky-mage-honk-transform-dialog-prompt = By what clown name will the station know you?
funky-mage-honk-transform-not-mage = You lack a mage's focus to finish the ritual.
funky-mage-honk-transform-busy = You are already weaving that transformation.
funky-mage-honk-transform-name-empty = The mask rejects an empty name.
funky-mage-honk-transform-no-mana = You run out of breath before the final honk.
funky-mage-honk-transform-outfit-fail = The blessed outfit refuses to manifest.
funky-mage-honk-transform-success = Honk! The mask fits. The shoes agree. The paperwork is… probably fine.

funky-grimoire-skill-tree-not-mage = The grimoire hums faintly; you have no focus to read it.
funky-grimoire-skill-tree-not-wizard = The grimoire slams shut. You are not marked as its wizard.
funky-grimoire-skill-tree-wrong-owner = The pages refuse to turn; this grimoire has already chosen its reader.
